  {
    "id": "1558345594919985252",
    "authorName": "core",
    "authorAvatarUrl": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/avatars/853217279466930178/4f03d93f0734da395e2636ac59efbaf3.png?size=128",
    "timestamp": "2026-10-10T05:09:02.490000+00:00",
    "content": "@everyone An actual Microsoft Flight Simulator clouds, ported to Grand Theft Auto V. Still work in progress but screenshots are already impressive.\n\n1:1 Scaled, 17 different cloud styles starting with few cumulus right to stormy towering clouds that you can pick in any weather. You can create your own cloud design in CloudBuilder app and import the preset into CoreFX.\n\nEnhanced and Legacy, and this is a teaser to a big announcement of a future collaboration with another visual overhaul team, so stay tuned!",
    "attachments": [
      {
        "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1080896900926017686/1558345585910874192/3240220_20261010074601_1.png?ex=6aec0f6c&is=6aeabdec&hm=566e750cd458822df7fafa37561fed2a66225eaf0c622a7ac0bf6c409c2f5e35&",
        "contentType": "image/png",
        "width": 3840,
        "height": 2160
      },
      {
        "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1080896900926017686/1558345586816716880/3240220_20261010074624_1.png?ex=6aec0f6c&is=6aeabdec&hm=04778f7030c3fff9611b0ba5c5b9c7c4361f9268441c2348b1117ff356f4eeaa&",
        "contentType": "image/png",
        "width": 3840,
        "height": 2160
